[node name="Explanation" type="RichTextLabel" parent="UI/HBox/ExplanationContainer" unique_id=1060593231]
layout_mode = 2
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b]Welcome to the Twitch-integration for Godot template project![/b]

Things won't work if you have not created your application and set up the Client ID in this project. To do so...
[font_size=14]
1) Please create a new application in the [url=https://dev.twitch.tv/console]Twitch Developer Console[/url] and copy the Client ID.
2) Within the Godot project, go to Project -> Tools -> Twitcher -> Setup
3) Select \"Game\"
4) Make sure \"Device Code Flow\" is selected
5) Enter the ID into \"Client ID\"
6) Hit \"Save\".[/font_size]


This project uses [url=https://twitcher.kani.dev/]Twitcher[/url], and it is highly recommended to read through the [url=https://twitcher.kani.dev/introduction/getting-started.html]Twitcher Quick Start Guide[/url] to learn how to do more things!

This project demonstrates basic functionality with the addon. You can test the Twitch integration by interacting with the buttons below, typing a command, or executing a redeem this project added to your account on Twitch!"
fit_content = true

